 The project's licence is open — plan §13 Q1, "GPL confirmation", which the
 plan itself notes is "cheap now, awkward after contributions".
 .
 This file is deliberately not guessing. A package built from this tree can be
 installed and measured, which is what M7 needs it for; it must not be
 published until this stanza names a real licence and a LICENSE file exists at
 the root of the repository to match. §11.3 opens the repositories with full
 history at first binary release, which is the same moment this stops being a
 question that can be left open.
